    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The concentric vault/radar field with a central lock, oversized editorial headline, and restrained cyan/amber security palette create a recognizable visual idea across all three viewports. However, the main artifact still resolves into familiar dark-dashboard cards and KPI boxes; the signature graphic is extremely faint and largely decorative, especially on mobile, so it falls short of an unmistakable demo moment.",
